  text={text}
  containerStyle={{ marginVertical: 12 }}
  textStyle={{ fontSize: 16 }}
  onExpand={() => console.log('Expanded')}
/>
```

**Important details:**

- Give the component a bounded width. In a horizontal parent, use `containerStyle={{ flex: 1 }}`.
- The button occupies a reserved area at the end of the first line rather than being a nested inline text run.
- The available width must accommodate the button. For exceptionally narrow containers or very large accessibility fonts, use a shorter label or allow a separate-line button.
